DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the meanest comedy show in Indianapolis.\n\nSureni W
 eerasekera is a Sri Lankan-born\, San Diego-raised\, & New York-based stand
 -up comedian\, actor\, and writer. She was recently announced as a performe
 r on 2024 Netflix is a Joke “Introducing…” showcase. She is known for
  her lighthearted\, conversational banter to her ruthless\, dark jabs. She 
 has performed at New York Comedy Festival\, San Francisco Sketchfest\, Desi
  Comedy Festival\, Oakland Comedy Festival\, and Silicon Valley Pride Festi
 val. She recently opened for Hari Kondabolu\, Irene Tu\, and Ashley Gavin. 
 She has been featured on Amazon Prime and HBO. Sureni was recently featured
  on Don’t Tell Comedy. With an aptitude for writing\, Sureni was awarded 
 the 2019 Diversity in Comedy Writing Fellowship at Killing My Lobster SF. S
 he is the creator of “Medium Roasts\,” a mini-video series about the ca
 fe world\, whom she wrote\, edited and acted in. She runs a monthly show ca
 lled Earth Tones at Union Hall in Brooklyn\, NY featuring QTBIPOC comics.\n
